{"conversation_id":"8a72cf3c-eedb-4508-8954-feef155eb900","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Subject: Venue update\n\nHi Dana,\n\nQuick update on Harbor Hall! I spoke with Priya yesterday afternoon. They confirmed March 12 and could do a walkthrough on March 3 if that works for us—let me know if you have a conflict that day.\n\nThe final number is $4,200 (under budget!), as they agreed to waive the AV setup fee since we're bringing our own projector. That covers up to 85 guests, which fits our RSVPs unless a lot of late people sign up.\n\nThe draft contract looks good, if you'd like to look before I sign anything. If I don't hear back I'm planning to send the signed contract back to them on Friday.\n\nThanks,\nSam\n","duration_seconds":33.368555342,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":12704,"output_tokens":3551,"thinking_tokens":3391,"cache_read_tokens":0,"total_tokens":16255}}
